Terminals unused in grammar

    ERRO


Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: declaration_list

    2 declaration_list: declaration_list declaration
    3                 | declaration

    4 declaration: var_declaration
    5            | fun_declaration

    6 var_declaration: type_specifier ID SEMICOLON
    7                | type_specifier error SEMICOLON
    8                | type_specifier ID ABRECOLCHETES NUM FECHACOLCHETES SEMICOLON
    9                | type_specifier error FECHACOLCHETES SEMICOLON

   10 type_specifier: INT
   11               | VOID

   12 fun_declaration: type_specifier fun_id ABREPARENTESES params FECHAPARENTESES compound_decl

   13 fun_id: ID

   14 params: param_list
   15       | VOID

   16 param_list: param_list COMMA param
   17           | param

   18 param: type_specifier ID
   19      | type_specifier ID ABRECOLCHETES FECHACOLCHETES

   20 compound_decl: ABRECHAVES local_declarations statement_list FECHACHAVES

   21 local_declarations: local_declarations var_declaration
   22                   | ε

   23 statement_list: statement_list statement
   24               | ε

   25 statement: expression_decl
   26          | compound_decl
   27          | selection_decl
   28          | iteration_decl
   29          | return_decl

   30 expression_decl: expression SEMICOLON
   31                | SEMICOLON
   32                | error SEMICOLON

   33 selection_decl: IF ABREPARENTESES expression FECHAPARENTESES statement
   34               | IF ABREPARENTESES expression FECHAPARENTESES statement ELSE statement

   35 iteration_decl: WHILE ABREPARENTESES expression FECHAPARENTESES statement

   36 return_decl: RETURN SEMICOLON
   37            | RETURN expression SEMICOLON

   38 expression: var ATRIB expression
   39           | simple_expression

   40 var: ID
   41    | ID ABRECOLCHETES expression FECHACOLCHETES

   42 simple_expression: simple_expression relational sum_expression
   43                  | sum_expression

   44 relational: relational_operand

   45 relational_operand: EQ
   46                   | NEQ
   47                   | LT
   48                   | GT
   49                   | LET
   50                   | GET

   51 sum_expression: sum_expression sum term
   52               | term

   53 sum: SOMA
   54    | SUB

   55 term: term mult factor
   56     | factor

   57 mult: MULT
   58     | DIV

   59 factor: ABREPARENTESES expression FECHAPARENTESES
   60       | var
   61       | activation
   62       | NUM

   63 activation: fun_id ABREPARENTESES args FECHAPARENTESES

   64 args: arg_list
   65     | ε

   66 arg_list: arg_list COMMA expression
   67         | expression


